- op: discuss  # 9606
  at: '2026-10-11T19:44:03Z'  # 9606
  by: agent  # 9606
  actor: jgstern_agent  # 9606
  clock: 4  # 9606
  nonce: '9606'  # 9606
  message: "Fixed in PR #1539 (merge 4309c9ddc6). Root cause: _extract_phoenix_routes walked every call in every file and minted a route for any get/post/put/patch/delete/head/options/resources/live call whose first positional arg was a string -- no router-module check, no pipe check. Fix: _iter_router_calls yields only calls inside a defmodule whose top-level body runs use Phoenix.Router, use <App>Web, :router, or use Plug.Router (HTTP verbs only for Plug); a nested defmodule starts afresh; a |> right-hand side is never a route macro. Evidence: (1) fixture (router with use AppWeb, :router + test with conn |> get(\"/pages\") and conn |> put_req_header(\"x\",\"y\") |> delete(\"/gone\") + cache with def get(k) and get(\"user_#{id}\")): hypergumbo routes <fixture> --include-tests -> 'Found 3 API route(s)', all lib/app_web/router.ex (GET /pages, DELETE /gone, LIVE /feed). (2) thc: analyze_elixir old (17a5440feb) vs new: 738 {router 377, lib 13, test 348} -> 377 {router 377}; router markers identical (name, line, controller, action: 377 == 377, equal). hypergumbo survey ~/special_repos/thc + hypergumbo routes --include-tests --format json -> 379 routes: router.ex 377, scanner/server.js 2 (JS, unrelated), no test or cache files. (3) lv_ws_load.js:195/:222 GET /red_carpet now links to nothing (only /red_carpet route is LIVE); filed INV-dubap-jufin-zisod-hamos-hariv-janod-topat-nigoj since Phoenix live expands to Phoenix.Router.get."  # 9606
